  "description": "Raw spice carries the promise of offworld supplies in a form a small caravan can transport. The sietch can sell it, deliver it under contract or refine it into melange doses.\n\nThe harvest is finite and its recovery dangerous. Bring the cargo home while the route remains open rather than counting wealth still lying beside an extractor.",
