  "sections": {
    "economy": {
      "body": "Ordinary delivery contracts exchange sixty raw spice for Solari, while institutional consignments buy specified supplies such as water, steel or components. Keep the cargo required by an active contract available until delivery."
    },
    "handling": {
      "body": "After Arrakis survival research, ten raw spice can be refined into four melange doses at a drug lab. Refining spends material that could otherwise support trade; personal doses also carry lasting exposure and dependence risks."
    },
    "overview": {
      "body": "Spice blows create temporary deposits on open sand. Workers collect the raw material by hand or with an extractor; the resulting cargo must still be hauled and stored."
    }
  },
